-                </li>
-                <li>
-                  <kbd>&lt;track-size&gt;</kbd>: <code>length</code>,
-                  <code>percentage</code>, <code>max-content</code>,
-                  <code>min-content</code>, <code>minmax(min, max)</code>,
-                  <code>auto</code>.
-                </li>
-                <li>
-                  Named grid lines (<kbd>&lt;custom-ident&gt;</kbd>)
