-                </li>
-                <li>
-                  Flexible lengths: <code>fr</code> unit
-                  [<a href="https://github.com/w3c/csswg-test/issues/647">#647</a>].
-                </li>
-                <li>
-                  <code>subgrid</code> keyword.
