-                  [<a href="https://github.com/w3c/csswg-test/issues/652">#652</a>].
-                </li>
-              </ul>
-            </li>
-          </ul>
-        </section>
-        <section>
-          <h4>The Implicit Grid (<kbd>implicit-grids</kbd>)</h4>
-          <ul>
-            <li>
